{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"users_node","type":"text","text":"## users\n---\n- **id**: uuid (PK)\n- **username**: string\n- **email**: string (UNIQUE, index)\n- **encrypted_password**: string\n- **mobile_number**: string (index)\n- **created_at**: datetime\n- **updated_at**: datetime\n- created_by: uuid(FK)\n- updated_by: uuid(FK)","x":-20,"y":60,"width":320,"height":240},
		{"id":"profiles_node","type":"text","text":"## profiles\n---\n- **id**: uuid (PK = users.id)\n- name: string\n- steamer_id: integer (UNIQUE, index)\n- **bio**: text\n- **father_name**: string\n- **mother_name**: string\n- **avatar_url**: string\n- gender: string\n- **address**: text\n- **date_of_birth**: date\n- **teacher_detail**: json\n  // {years_of_experience, qualification, subjects: []}\n- **experience**: json\n  // [{type, description, duration, organization}]\n- **student_details**: json\n  // {grade, section, roll_number, enrollment_date}\n  // Note: School association via school_user table\n- **alternate_mobile_number**: string\n- **created_at**: datetime\n- **updated_at**: datetime\n- **created_by**: uuid (FK)\n- **updated_by**: uuid (FK)\n","x":-600,"y":-60,"width":300,"height":700},
